    "detailed_description": "<strong>Meet Conrad the condor and help him in his dangerous quest through multiple levels and traps as he collects as many coins as he can (in a limited time) to help save his species from extinction.</strong><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>*Multiple levels and traps, each increasing with intensity as you progress.<br>*Characters speed adjusted according to each level, to make it more challenging.<br>*Each level is made to test your mechanical skills, and made to push you to your limits.<br>*Fine tuned game timer to keep you under pressure.<br>*Main menu and in game volume adjustable to player preference.",
